    "id": "N16-04-10",
    "chapterId": "04",
    "text": "面对采用新技术的同行，企业同样会促使更高产出进入排期和考核，",
    "startMs": 155600,
    "endMs": 161733,
    "timestampMs": 155600,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 155600.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 161748.666,
    "sentenceId": "S16-04-05",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-04-10",
      "N15-04-11"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 155100,
    "sourceEndMs": 161500,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-04-11",
    "chapterId": "04",
    "text": "使原本的额外贡献转为新的基准，",
    "startMs": 161733,
    "endMs": 164800,
    "timestampMs": 161749,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 161748.666,
    "voiceEndMs": 164801.333,
    "sentenceId": "S16-04-05",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-04-12"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 161500,
    "sourceEndMs": 164700,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-04-12",
    "chapterId": "04",
    "text": "以在激烈竞争的市场中维持产品交付的优势。",
    "startMs": 164800,
    "endMs": 168567,
    "timestampMs": 164801,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 164801.333,
    "voiceEndMs": 168432.874,
    "sentenceId": "S16-04-05",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-04-13"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 164700,
    "sourceEndMs": 168300,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-04-13",
    "chapterId": "04",
    "text": "因此：Agent 带来的普遍生产力提升造成了工作标准的提升，",
    "startMs": 169433,
    "endMs": 174267,
    "timestampMs": 169440,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 169440.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 174292.375,
    "sentenceId": "S16-04-06",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-04-14"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 168300,
    "sourceEndMs": 173467,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-04-14",
    "chapterId": "04",
    "text": "从“能多做”，到“必须做”。",
    "startMs": 174267,
    "endMs": 176533,
    "timestampMs": 174292,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 174292.375,
    "voiceEndMs": 176397.666,
    "sentenceId": "S16-04-06",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-04-15"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 173467,
    "sourceEndMs": 177000,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-01",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "或许有人会认为 Agent 总能分担一部分工作，",
    "startMs": 177433,
    "endMs": 181033,
    "timestampMs": 177440,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 177440.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 181045.541,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-01",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-01"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 177400,
    "sourceEndMs": 180967,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-02",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "为劳动者增加自主性；",
    "startMs": 181033,
    "endMs": 183067,
    "timestampMs": 181046,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 181045.541,
    "voiceEndMs": 182940.24899999998,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-01",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-02"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 180967,
    "sourceEndMs": 183700,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-03",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "然而调度多个 Agent 可能会让部分员工产生",
    "startMs": 183767,
    "endMs": 187400,
    "timestampMs": 183770,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 183770.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 187418.16600000003,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-02",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-03"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 183700,
    "sourceEndMs": 187300,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-04",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "指挥“虚拟员工”的错觉，却未必会赋予任何作为雇主的权力；",
    "startMs": 187400,
    "endMs": 192400,
    "timestampMs": 187418,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 187418.16600000003,
    "voiceEndMs": 192247.082,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-02",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-04",
      "N15-05-05"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 187300,
    "sourceEndMs": 193400,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-05",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "这些“虚拟员工”反而会要求员工付出更多的成本，",
    "startMs": 193067,
    "endMs": 197067,
    "timestampMs": 193098,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 193097.625,
    "voiceEndMs": 197097.625,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-03",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-06"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 193400,
    "sourceEndMs": 197200,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-06",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "例如额外的时间和金钱，",
    "startMs": 197067,
    "endMs": 199100,
    "timestampMs": 197098,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 197097.625,
    "voiceEndMs": 199110.791,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-03",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-07"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 197200,
    "sourceEndMs": 200067,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-07",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "以维持自己作为“虚拟雇主”的身份。",
    "startMs": 199100,
    "endMs": 201767,
    "timestampMs": 199111,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 199110.791,
    "voiceEndMs": 201637.082,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-03",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-08"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 200067,
    "sourceEndMs": 203400,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-08",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "通过对劳动者施加竞争压力，",
    "startMs": 202467,
    "endMs": 205033,
    "timestampMs": 202490,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 202490.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 205040.25,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-04",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-09"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 203400,
    "sourceEndMs": 206400,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-09",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "社会劳动创造的生产力，在特定的占有和组织关系中，",
    "startMs": 205033,
    "endMs": 209600,
    "timestampMs": 205040,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 205040.25,
    "voiceEndMs": 209632.375,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-04",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-10"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 206400,
    "sourceEndMs": 210267,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-10",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "反而会成为约束劳动者的外在力量。",
    "startMs": 209600,
    "endMs": 212667,
    "timestampMs": 209632,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 209632.375,
    "voiceEndMs": 212513.957,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-04",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-11"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 210267,
    "sourceEndMs": 213500,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-11",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "这是劳动异化的一个侧面：具体的指令由劳动者发出，",
    "startMs": 213367,
    "endMs": 217800,
    "timestampMs": 213388,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 213387.625,
    "voiceEndMs": 217821.83299999998,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-05",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-12",
      "N15-05-13"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 213500,
    "sourceEndMs": 218933,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-05-12",
    "chapterId": "05",
    "text": "而劳动的目的与尺度仍可能由他人设定。",
    "startMs": 217800,
    "endMs": 221933,
    "timestampMs": 217822,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 217821.83299999998,
    "voiceEndMs": 221782.374,
    "sentenceId": "S16-05-05",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-05-14"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 218933,
    "sourceEndMs": 222000,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-01",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "总而言之，效率收益可以转化为更多交付，",
    "startMs": 222433,
    "endMs": 225933,
    "timestampMs": 222448,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 222447.625,
    "voiceEndMs": 225934.458,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-01",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-01"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 222400,
    "sourceEndMs": 226100,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-02",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "也可以转化为更短工时。",
    "startMs": 225933,
    "endMs": 227933,
    "timestampMs": 225934,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 225934.458,
    "voiceEndMs": 227789.75,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-01",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-02"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 226100,
    "sourceEndMs": 229100,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-03",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "区别在于谁决定生产规模，谁分配节约的时间。",
    "startMs": 228800,
    "endMs": 233233,
    "timestampMs": 228818,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 228817.625,
    "voiceEndMs": 233080.75,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-02",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-03"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 229100,
    "sourceEndMs": 233000,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-04",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "在生产力飞跃的时代，需要让劳动者参与确定任务边界，",
    "startMs": 234067,
    "endMs": 238600,
    "timestampMs": 234080,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 234080.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 238626.04100000003,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-03",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-04",
      "N15-06-05"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 233000,
    "sourceEndMs": 238900,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-05",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "并获得实际可支配的时间，",
    "startMs": 238600,
    "endMs": 240967,
    "timestampMs": 238626,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 238626.04100000003,
    "voiceEndMs": 240968.16600000003,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-03",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-06"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 238900,
    "sourceEndMs": 241800,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-06",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "技术进步才有机会转化为人的自由。",
    "startMs": 240967,
    "endMs": 244033,
    "timestampMs": 240968,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 240968.16600000003,
    "voiceEndMs": 243889.207,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-03",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-07"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 241800,
    "sourceEndMs": 245000,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-07",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "由此，劳动者才不会陷入无休止的竞争，",
    "startMs": 244867,
    "endMs": 248200,
    "timestampMs": 244880,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 244880.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 248232.875,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-04",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-08"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 245000,
    "sourceEndMs": 249067,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-08",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "市场才能远离生产过剩和衰退的危机。",
    "startMs": 248200,
    "endMs": 251733,
    "timestampMs": 248233,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 248232.875,
    "voiceEndMs": 251601.291,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-04",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-09"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 249067,
    "sourceEndMs": 253000,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-09",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "效率何时成为义务，取决于谁有权为工作画上句号。",
    "startMs": 253033,
    "endMs": 257533,
    "timestampMs": 253040,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 253040.0,
    "voiceEndMs": 257395.49999999997,
    "sentenceId": "S16-06-05",
    "sourceIds": [
      "N15-06-10"
    ],
    "sourceStartMs": 253000,
    "sourceEndMs": 258833,
    "timing": "Microsoft WordBoundary character offsets; display rounded to30fps"
  },
  {
    "id": "N16-06-10",
    "chapterId": "06",
    "text": "在 Agent 时代，记得好好生活。",
    "startMs": 257900,
    "endMs": 260367,
    "timestampMs": 257910,
    "confidence": null,
    "voiceStartMs": 257909.99999999997,
    "voiceEndMs": 260229.20799999998,
